    <briefdescription>
<para>Specialized <ref refid="classsf_1_1SoundRecorder" kindref="compound">SoundRecorder</ref> which stores the captured audio data into a sound buffer. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><computeroutput><ref refid="classsf_1_1SoundBufferRecorder" kindref="compound">sf::SoundBufferRecorder</ref></computeroutput> allows to access a recorded sound through a <computeroutput><ref refid="classsf_1_1SoundBuffer" kindref="compound">sf::SoundBuffer</ref></computeroutput>, so that it can be played, saved to a file, etc.</para>
<para>It has the same simple interface as its base class (<computeroutput><ref refid="classsf_1_1SoundRecorder_1a715f0fd2f228c83d79aaedca562ae51f" kindref="member">start()</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="classsf_1_1SoundRecorder_1a8d9c8346aa9aa409cfed4a1101159c4c" kindref="member">stop()</ref></computeroutput>) and adds a function to retrieve the recorded sound buffer (<computeroutput><ref refid="classsf_1_1SoundBufferRecorder_1a1befea2bfa3959ff6fabbf7e33cbc864" kindref="member">getBuffer()</ref></computeroutput>).</para>
<para>As usual, don&apos;t forget to call the <computeroutput><ref refid="classsf_1_1SoundRecorder_1aab2bd0fee9e48d6cfd449b1cb078ce5a" kindref="member">isAvailable()</ref></computeroutput> function before using this class (see <computeroutput><ref refid="classsf_1_1SoundRecorder" kindref="compound">sf::SoundRecorder</ref></computeroutput> for more details about this).</para>
<para>Usage example: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(<ref refid="classsf_1_1SoundRecorder_1aab2bd0fee9e48d6cfd449b1cb078ce5a" kindref="member">sf::SoundBufferRecorder::isAvailable</ref>())</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Record<sp/>some<sp/>audio<sp/>data</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>sf::SoundBufferRecorder<sp/>recorder;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(!recorder.<ref refid="classsf_1_1SoundRecorder_1a715f0fd2f228c83d79aaedca562ae51f" kindref="member">start</ref>())</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Handle<sp/>error...</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>recorder.<ref refid="classsf_1_1SoundRecorder_1a8d9c8346aa9aa409cfed4a1101159c4c" kindref="member">stop</ref>();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Get<sp/>the<sp/>buffer<sp/>containing<sp/>the<sp/>captured<sp/>audio<sp/>data</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">const</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>sf::SoundBuffer&amp;<sp/>buffer<sp/>=<sp/>recorder.<ref refid="classsf_1_1SoundBufferRecorder_1a1befea2bfa3959ff6fabbf7e33cbc864" kindref="member">getBuffer</ref>();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Save<sp/>it<sp/>to<sp/>a<sp/>file<sp/>(for<sp/>example...)</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(!buffer.<ref refid="classsf_1_1SoundBuffer_1ab6a37b1508233b505db66a0e47304ae8" kindref="member">saveToFile</ref>(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;my_record.ogg&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">))</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Handle<sp/>error...</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><computeroutput><ref refid="classsf_1_1SoundRecorder" kindref="compound">sf::SoundRecorder</ref></computeroutput> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
